<title>USA: Badger Paper Mills Inc Q3 net off.</title>
<headline>Badger Paper Mills Inc Q3 net off.</headline>
<dateline>PESHTIGO, Wis. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.22   profit	 $0.53</p>
<p> Net profit		   429   profit	 1,032</p>
