<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 nine-month results include $7.4 million charge due to closing of the company's pulp mill in the 1996 Q2. This was partly offset by a gain of $4.9 million from the sale of certain timberlands during the 1996 Q2 and Q3.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
